We first recall from \cite{MMR1}, proof of Proposition 3.1, the following controls for all $s\in [0,s_0]$,
\begin{equation}
\label{weightedone}
\int_{y>0}y\e^2(s)\lesssim \left(1+\frac{1}{\l^{\frac{10}9}(s)}\right)\mathcal{N}_{1,\rm loc}^{\frac 89}(s),
