{\bf step 3}  Estimates induced by the conservation laws.
By $L^2$ norm conservation,
\begin{align*}
& \int u^2(0) - \int Q^2  = \int Q_b^2 - \int Q^2 + \int (\e+p\Yz+q)^2 + 2 \int (\e+p\Yz +q) Q_b\\
&= 2 b(P,Q) + O(|b|^{2-\gamma}) +\|\e\|_{L^2}^2 + O(|b|^{1-\frac \gamma 2}\|\e\|_{L^2}) +O(|p|+   \|q\|_{L^2}).
\end{align*}
Estimate \eqref{twobound} follows. By energy conservation, $Q''+Q^5= Q$  and $\int \e Q=0$,
\begin{align*} & 2 \l^2 E(u_0)   = 2 E(Q_b + \e + p\Yz +q) \\& = 2 E(Q_b) - 2 \int (\e+p\Yz + q) \left( (Q_b-Q)_{yy}+ (Q_b^5 - Q^5) \right)
